  ["Multi-row header offsets are measured; frozen-column selectors are scoped to thead tr:not(.fw-grouprow) / tbody; column-group colspan is recomputed on expand.", "Each of these failed at least once on the WIP/AR board (a 5px band of body rows above the header; a frozen column-group header; uncovered columns).", "standards/design/v1.md:127-136; context/memory/2026-08-21.md:302-306", "2026-08-21"],
