  ["Numbers right-aligned with tabular numerals; labels left; no mixed alignments within a group; table-layout: fixed on the executive jobs table.", "Rows must align regardless of name length.", "global.css:3530-3536, :3643-3646", ""],
  ["A wide table scrolls its own wrapper (overflow-x: auto) inside a surface that clips (overflow-x: clip), never the page or nav.", "Client report: the panel pushed under the left nav.", "invoice-audit.astro:202-209", "2026-06-28"],
  ["Rows on WIP went from 67px to 29px; page height 4,465 → 1,021px; 3 → 11 visible rows.", "Measured at 1920×900 after Chris's screen recording of the scroll problems.", "context/memory/2026-08-21.md:295-298", "2026-08-21"],
